# Afenda package scaffolds (`packages/features/**`, `packages/*`)

Scaffold index: [`packages/_scaffold`](../../packages/_scaffold) · **ARCH-1002** §6–§8.

## Feature packages (`@afenda/feature-*`)

Template: [`packages/_scaffold/feature`](../../packages/_scaffold/feature).

### Public doors (`src/`)

- `src/index.ts` → export `.`
- `src/client.ts` → export `./client`
- `src/server.ts` → export `./server` (imports `@afenda/kernel/server`)
- `src/metadata.ts` → export `./metadata`

### Template buckets

- `actions/` · `commands/` · `api/` · `contracts/` · `components/` · `data/` · `domain/` · `events/` · `policies/` · `read-models/` · `schemas/` · `tests/`

Vertical slice: full bucket set under `src/<capability>/`.

## Platform packages (`@afenda/*`, not under `features/`)

Template: [`packages/_scaffold/platform`](../../packages/_scaffold/platform). **No ERP module business rules.**

## Non-negotiables

- Do not add catch-all folders: `_shared`, `shared`, `common`, `lib`, `utils`, `helpers`, `misc`, `internal`.
- Module components live in feature `components/`, not `apps/erp`.
- TypeScript schemas in feature `schemas/`; `@afenda/db` owns SQL and migrations.
- Server Actions: `src/actions/**/*.actions.server.ts`.
- Feature packages never own Drizzle DDL.

## Tools

- `pnpm scaffold:feature <moduleId>` — ERP module under `packages/features/`
- `pnpm scaffold:vertical <feature> <capability>` — vertical slice buckets
- `pnpm scaffold:platform <slug>` — platform package under `packages/`
- `pnpm architecture:check` — before finishing scaffold changes
